{
    "word": "shi'a",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "97dad6a9-cf96-37cf-8303-b898a5c9524e",
                "word": "Shi'a",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2a68535f-2abd-369f-84e2-9caf935408f1",
                        "entry_id": "97dad6a9-cf96-37cf-8303-b898a5c9524e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The branch of Islam that believes that Ali succeeded Muhammad as leader, and that places emphasis on the prophet's family."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5df0cd75-1c85-40a1-a3e4-7fcecc1ebbf7",
                                "sense_id": "2a68535f-2abd-369f-84e2-9caf935408f1",
                                "text": "In Islam, Sunni is a more triumphant version of the faith than Shia, which stresses the importance of suffering, following the founder Ali, who was persecuted."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c0dc321-e7b7-4891-8464-0ee2dfcf7118",
                                "sense_id": "2a68535f-2abd-369f-84e2-9caf935408f1",
                                "text": "Shi’a is one of the two larger divisions of Islam, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1709b405-4385-4f8c-90ab-b32de4d1893d",
                                "sense_id": "2a68535f-2abd-369f-84e2-9caf935408f1",
                                "text": "Jordanians do not know what Shi’a is about, and it was very recently, [the] last few years, when we start[ed] being exposed to Shi’a."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d22fe9e2-9d5a-4f57-8f39-b3920dd97928",
                                "sense_id": "2a68535f-2abd-369f-84e2-9caf935408f1",
                                "text": "But the Shī'a was not yet a sect; there can as yet be no division of Islam between Shi'ite and Sunni."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0074612a-15be-3ad2-8bca-ae73d31ed78e",
                        "entry_id": "97dad6a9-cf96-37cf-8303-b898a5c9524e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The followers of this branch of Islam; the Shiites."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "collective"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e482f2d8-e534-4c59-87fb-26727fab6cb0",
                                "sense_id": "0074612a-15be-3ad2-8bca-ae73d31ed78e",
                                "text": "Throughout the Umayyad period, the Shi'a were confined to southern 'Iraq [...]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7da23cbf-1c7c-47fe-8ff0-0aca8d9465bc",
                        "source_entry_id": "97dad6a9-cf96-37cf-8303-b898a5c9524e",
                        "source_sense_description": "branch of Islam",
                        "target_lang_word": "sjia",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sjia",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d3a5145-49fe-3969-9d0e-4fcc3ff2080d",
                                        "entry_id": "0a05a856-3fe8-3790-8a75-1d9fb842b7be",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een van de twee grote stromingen binnen de islam"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8860af0f-c8cb-4ac3-8ec9-f9b5694a73af",
                                                "sense_id": "1d3a5145-49fe-3969-9d0e-4fcc3ff2080d",
                                                "text": "De bommen ontploften op drie verschillende plekken, terwijl 35 duizend sjiieten hun processie hielden in de straten van Lahore. Zij herdachten de dood van kalief Ali, een van de heiligste mannen binnen de sjia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6694d5e2-9df9-48dc-86f5-fb3bb7c5f334",
                                                "sense_id": "1d3a5145-49fe-3969-9d0e-4fcc3ff2080d",
                                                "text": "Bij de gevechten komen 196 IS-strijders om het leven. 96 dorpen rondom Hawija zijn bevrijd. De Verenigde Staten, maar ook Iraans-getrainde sjia milities steunen het Irakese leger."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b010961e-70e7-427d-9654-54faefca7fe8",
                        "source_entry_id": "97dad6a9-cf96-37cf-8303-b898a5c9524e",
                        "source_sense_description": "branch of Islam",
                        "target_lang_word": "chiisme",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chiisme",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "22cc7a29-a148-390a-9296-f39d2df0fe8f",
                                        "entry_id": "6e3de58a-3d6d-3f83-95a2-e1e39d1b9dd0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Branche de l’islam qui professe que des personnes choisies parmi la famille de Mahomet (les imams) sont la meilleure source de connaissance à propos du Coran, de l’Islam et les protecteurs les plus fervents de la sunnah de Mahomet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3ee53ae-a2cb-4b23-a3b3-02456ef60705",
                                                "sense_id": "22cc7a29-a148-390a-9296-f39d2df0fe8f",
                                                "text": "Si, pour l’heure, la population de la Perse est en grande majorité sunnite, le chiisme représente déjà quelques îlots, notamment les villes oasis de Kom et de Kashan où d’étranges traditions sont perpétuées. Chaque année, on célèbre par un carnaval burlesque l’anniversaire du meurtre du calife Omar."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "797b01f4-add4-44ac-ba71-e4fda4af0904",
                                                "sense_id": "22cc7a29-a148-390a-9296-f39d2df0fe8f",
                                                "text": "Le haut clergé chiite, de plus en plus majoritairement iranien, a eu de plus en plus tendance à identifier la cause du chiisme et celle de la nation iranienne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d1098c0-a013-48c2-b826-007269c11abb",
                                                "sense_id": "22cc7a29-a148-390a-9296-f39d2df0fe8f",
                                                "text": "Le chiisme obéit au principe propre aux religions, toutes convaincues de détenir le Vrai message révélant la Vérité unique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9e56b53-5bfd-4042-9047-ab96cd05fe79",
                                                "sense_id": "22cc7a29-a148-390a-9296-f39d2df0fe8f",
                                                "text": "Le chiisme (ou chi’isme), de son côté regroupe ceux qui croient que l’interprétation des textes sacrés est un privilège des descendants de l’imam Ali qui devraient par conséquent prendre les commandes de la communauté."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f4c9b3d4-3373-452a-b3a4-f66182758ca6",
